Route22_Text_LeagueGateSign::
	.string "POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
	.string "Front Gate$"

Route22_Text_JeffIntro::
	.string "I camp on ROUTE 22 because the\n"
	.string "road feels wilder than VIRIDIAN.\p"
	.string "Let's see how you handle rough\n"
	.string "ground!$"

Route22_Text_JeffRematchIntro::
	.string "Back from the city road?\p"
	.string "Good. ROUTE 22 should test your\n"
	.string "footing again!$"

Route22_Text_JeffDefeat::
	.string "Lost my footing!$"

Route22_Text_JeffPostBattle::
	.string "This route is the first place west\n"
	.string "of VIRIDIAN that feels properly\l"
	.string "rugged.\p"
	.string "That's why SCOUTS learn a lot\n"
	.string "here.$"

Route22_Text_AliciaIntro::
	.string "The LEAGUE gate makes this road\n"
	.string "feel serious.\p"
	.string "A SCOUT still has to notice the\n"
	.string "small paths too!$"

Route22_Text_AliciaRematchIntro::
	.string "I checked the rocks, grass, and\n"
	.string "gate road again.\p"
	.string "Now I want to check your team!$"

Route22_Text_AliciaDefeat::
	.string "You noticed my opening!$"

Route22_Text_AliciaPostBattle::
	.string "People stare north toward the\n"
	.string "LEAGUE, but ROUTE 22 spreads out\l"
	.string "before that.\p"
	.string "There's always more than one way\n"
	.string "to cross rough terrain.$"

Route22_Text_JarenIntro::
	.string "This broken-up road is perfect\n"
	.string "for hard turns.\p"
	.string "Let's see if your battle style\n"
	.string "can corner like that!$"

Route22_Text_JarenRematchIntro::
	.string "I know every bend between\n"
	.string "VIRIDIAN and the LEAGUE gate.\p"
	.string "Try keeping up again!$"

Route22_Text_JarenDefeat::
	.string "Skidded out!$"

Route22_Text_JarenPostBattle::
	.string "Flat roads make lazy riders.\p"
	.string "ROUTE 22 keeps your hands tight\n"
	.string "and your eyes open.$"

Route22_Text_RobertIntro::
	.string "Birds ride the wind coming down\n"
	.string "from the LEAGUE cliffs.\p"
	.string "My team trains in that air!$"

Route22_Text_RobertRematchIntro::
	.string "The wind changed since last time.\p"
	.string "Let's see if our battle changes\n"
	.string "with it!$"

Route22_Text_RobertDefeat::
	.string "My wings dipped!$"

Route22_Text_RobertPostBattle::
	.string "The closer you get to the LEAGUE,\n"
	.string "the stronger the wind feels.\p"
	.string "Bird POKéMON love a road that\n"
	.string "makes them work.$"

Route22_Text_JeremyIntro::
	.string "You can feel the land rising\n"
	.string "toward the LEAGUE gate.\p"
	.string "A HIKER notices every slope!$"

Route22_Text_JeremyRematchIntro::
	.string "Back on the west road?\p"
	.string "Then let's climb into another\n"
	.string "battle!$"

Route22_Text_JeremyDefeat::
	.string "Rolled downhill!$"

Route22_Text_JeremyPostBattle::
	.string "ROUTE 22 is rough, but not wild\n"
	.string "without purpose.\p"
	.string "It prepares your legs before the\n"
	.string "LEAGUE road gets serious.$"

Route22_Text_TriathleteFLandIntro::
	.string "I run from VIRIDIAN to the\n"
	.string "LEAGUE gate and back.\p"
	.string "Rough terrain builds endurance!$"

Route22_Text_TriathleteFLandRematchIntro::
	.string "Another run, another rematch.\p"
	.string "Let's see whose pace holds on\n"
	.string "ROUTE 22!$"

Route22_Text_TriathleteFLandDefeat::
	.string "I need to pace myself!$"

Route22_Text_TriathleteFLandPostBattle::
	.string "Strong legs, steady breath,\n"
	.string "and a good partner POKéMON.\p"
	.string "That's how you cross rough\n"
	.string "terrain.$"
